{
  "title": "MariaDB — Tables & Indexes",
  "uid": "mariadb-tables-indexes",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "tags": [
    "mariadb",
    "userstat",
    "tables",
    "indexes"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Requires userstat=ON. The tablestat/indexstat collectors apply a per-scrape limit (--collector.tablestat.limit, --collector.indexstat.limit), sorting by rows_read DESC — so the busiest tables and indexes are always the ones kept.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus"
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(mariadb_up, cluster)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(mariadb_up{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, environment)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2
      },
      {
        "name": "service_name",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(mariadb_up{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\"}, service_name)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2
      },
      {
        "name": "schema",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(mariadb_table_rows_read_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}, schema)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Unused Indexes",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "How to read this section",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "MariaDB's `INDEX_STATISTICS` **only lists indexes that have been read at least once**. An index never touched since the last restart doesn't appear in the table — and therefore never shows up with `rows_read = 0`.\n\nIn practice this means **`mariadb_index_unused` is usually empty**: it only catches the specific case of an index already present in the table whose counter is at zero.\n\nTo detect indexes that are **truly** orphaned, use the `mariadb_orphan_indexes` custom metric, already included in `custom_metrics/example.yml` — it does a `LEFT JOIN` between the declared indexes (`STATISTICS`) and the ones that recorded reads (`INDEX_STATISTICS`). Enable it with:\n\n```\nmariadb_exporter --custom-metrics=/etc/mariadb_exporter/example.yml\n```\n\nThe *Orphan indexes by schema* panel below consumes this metric.\n\n> Only trust the result if uptime covers a full business cycle: an index used only during month-end closing will look orphaned if the server restarted yesterday. Confirm with the application team before removing."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total unused indexes (see note above)",
      "description": "Indexes present in INDEX_STATISTICS with rows_read = 0. Usually 0 because never-read indexes don't enter the table — read the note panel above.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(mariadb_index_unused{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Orphan indexes by schema (custom metric)",
      "description": "From mariadb_orphan_indexes (custom_metrics/example.yml): declared indexes that never recorded a read. This is the reliable number — the native mariadb_index_unused metric doesn't detect indexes that were never touched.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mariadb_orphan_indexes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} / {{schema_name}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Total orphan indexes",
      "description": "Sum of mariadb_orphan_indexes. Zero may mean the custom metric isn't enabled — check the note panel.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(mariadb_orphan_indexes{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 20 }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Removal candidates — indexes with no reads at all",
      "description": "Confirm with the application team before removing: the index may serve a routine that runs less often than the server's uptime (e.g. month-end closing). PRIMARY must never be removed.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "mariadb_index_unused{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true,
              "Value": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "service_name": "Instance",
              "schema": "Schema",
              "table": "Table",
              "index": "Index"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Schema"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Most Accessed Tables",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Top 10 tables by reads",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, rate(mariadb_table_rows_read_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{schema}}.{{table}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Top 10 tables by writes",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, rate(mariadb_table_rows_changed_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{schema}}.{{table}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Index cost on writes (rows_changed_x_indexes / rows_changed)",
      "description": "How many indexes are effectively updated per changed row. A high value on a write-heavy table indicates too many indexes making every INSERT/UPDATE more expensive.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, rate(mariadb_table_rows_changed_x_indexes_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]) / clamp_min(rate(mariadb_table_rows_changed_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]), 0.001))",
          "legendFormat": "{{schema}}.{{table}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Write amplification from indexes",
      "description": "Total index updates per second. This is the real maintenance cost of indexes under write load.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, rate(mariadb_table_rows_changed_x_indexes_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{schema}}.{{table}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Indexes in Use",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Top 10 indexes by reads",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(10, rate(mariadb_index_rows_read_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{schema}}.{{table}}.{{index}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Detail by table",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 41
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, rate(mariadb_table_rows_read_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "READ"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(mariadb_table_rows_changed_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\", environment=~\"$environment\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", schema=~\"$schema\"}[5m])",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "WRITE"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "schema": "Schema",
              "table": "Table",
              "Value #READ": "Reads/s",
              "Value #WRITE": "Writes/s"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
